{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01029","headline":"相和歌辞 公无渡河 · 王建","name":"相和歌辞 公无渡河","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"渡头恶天两岸远，波涛塞川如叠坂。\n幸无白刃驱向前，何用将身自弃捐。\n蛟龙啮屍鱼食血，黄泥直下无青天。\n男儿纵轻妇人语，惜君性命还须取。\n妇人无力挽断衣，舟沈身死悔难追，公无渡河公自爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王建","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01029.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01029","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}